# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your own values. `.env` is
# gitignored - `otto-cli` and `otto-ui` both load it automatically on
# startup (via `dotenvy`), searched from the current directory upward, so it
# works whether you run from the workspace root or a crate directory.
#
# These are the OS-keychain fallback env vars from otto-core::KeyringStore -
# a keychain entry (via `keyring`, service "otto-assistant") always takes
# priority over these if both are set.

# Required.
OTTO_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
OTTO_GITHUB_TOKEN=ghp_...

# Optional - defaults shown are what the code falls back to when unset.
# OTTO_MODEL=claude-opus-5
# OTTO_DEFAULT_REPO=owner/name
# OTTO_PERSONA=                    # empty disables the persona addition entirely

# Optional - lets "Sign in with GitHub" (Device Flow) work; see README's
# "GitHub OAuth App setup" section. Pasting a token instead needs none of this.
# OTTO_GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=Iv1.xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# Optional - voice (otto-ui only; see README's Voice setup section).
# OTTO_WHISPER_MODEL=/path/to/ggml-base.en.bin

# Optional - scheduling (otto-ui only). Set both or neither.
# OTTO_ACTIVE_FROM=09:00
# OTTO_ACTIVE_UNTIL=18:00

# Optional - growth digest interval, in hours (otto-ui only).
# OTTO_GROWTH_INTERVAL_HOURS=24
